  "facts": [
   "Each of the 67 WBs holds one u32 Field_5198399a.Field_2b6f2936 (sprint) and one u32 Field_2c3e0fbf.Field_2b6f2936 (deploy); no holster field exists in any WB.",
   "DTA_Weapons (12 rows) and DTA_Sidearms (15 rows) hold per-row Field_ada3e7d9 (draw) and Field_6225d335 (holster) f32 seconds; the WB deploy index selects one row, so draw and holster share one index. All 54 values equal data/balance_tables.json DRAW_TIME_TABLES within 6e-5 ms (f32 rounding).",
   "WB DTA import: 61 weapons import DTA_Weapons, 6 import DTA_Sidearms; equals the site table key for all 67 (VZ61 keeps primary).",
   "WB sprint/deploy indices equal data/attachments.json WEAPON_MAG sprintRecoveryBaseIndex/deployBaseIndex for 67/67.",
   "All 67 WBs import SSA_Weapons (not Launchers/Melee); SSA_Weapons imports SprintSettings_T00..T11 in order. SprintSettings Class_25b57f30 stores Field_0eb3af2f equal to Field_1392aeff (identical bytes in all 12; 400.001 down to 50.001 ms) and Field_a89f7448 = 0 in all 12; Field_1d49859f is null. These equal DRAW_TIME_TABLES.sprint.",
   "WM_WeaponSwap stores Class_4aac041b Field_9540bd8e = +1 (i32 at offset 216)."
